OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy for
OL,6,Fmost places, with outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Faffecting some areas, while others
OL,8,Fremain dry with occasional clear
OL,9,Fspells which will allow fog to develop
OL,10,Fby dawn. Winds will remain light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA largely cloudy morning, with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain slowly clearing
OL,14,Fsouthwards. Drier conditions will
OL,15,Ffollow, with a few breaks in the cloud
OL,16,Fdeveloping by the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
