OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells on Saturday.
OL,7,FCloudier but dry for most on Sunday,
OL,8,Falthough Hampshire may see some rain
OL,9,Fedging in. Cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,10,Frain on Monday.
